[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   TEP / Planet-9 -- step b3: robustness of the detached cluster
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   A result carried by a handful of objects, one discovery era, or a
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   loose significance convention is not a result.  This step stress-
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   tests the detached (a>150, q>30, cc<=3, N=44) varpi cluster.
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   J1  Leave-one-out jackknife: recompute mean varpi and the
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   conditioned-null p-value with each object removed.  If any
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   single object's removal destroys the signal, the cluster is
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   a small-N artifact of that object.
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   J2  Discovery-era split.  The anomaly was announced by Trujillo &
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   Sheppard (2014) and amplified by Batygin & Brown (2016);
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   post-announcement surveys specifically targeted the cluster
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   longitude.  If the cluster appears only in post-2014/2016
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   discoveries, targeted pointing (a self-fulfilling footprint)
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   is implicated.  If the pre-announcement subsample alone
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   clusters at the same axis, the direction predates the search.
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   Split uses the catalogued first_observation date.
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   J3  Orbit-quality splits: numbered vs provisional-only
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   designations, and arc-length split at the sample median --
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   does the signal live in the best-measured orbits?
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   J4  Epoch audit: verify all elements share one osculating epoch
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   (angles at mixed epochs would smear any true structure).
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   J5  Multiple-testing accounting: every p-value quoted in the
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   step_02..step_08 result files is collected; Bonferroni and
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   Benjamini-Hochberg q-values are reported so the reader sees
[2026-09-21 14:31:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 023]   which statements survive familywise control.
